<title>USA: Immunogen says CFO Pocher dies in crash.</title>
<headline>Immunogen says CFO Pocher dies in crash.</headline>
<dateline>CAMBRIDGE, Mass. 1997-04-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>ImmunoGen, Inc said Tuesday that its chief financial officer, Frank Pocher, was killed in a plane crash on Saturday.</p>
<p>Pocher was also executive vice president of operations and a director of biotechnology company.</p>
<p>Company officials were not immediately available for other details.</p>
<p>((- New York Newsdesk, 212 859-1610))</p>
</text>
